ears, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 66% of normal in August to September and 62% in November to December. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 159% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22379 had its driest year in 1953 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
